|               |  Projection: store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk, store_sales.ss_item_sk, store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price, item.i_item_sk, item.i_item_id, item.i_item_desc, item.i_current_price, item.i_class, item.i_category, date_dim.d_date_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
