|               |       TableScan: item projection=[i_item_sk, i_item_id, i_item_desc, i_current_price, i_class, i_category], full_filters=[item.i_category IN ([Utf8("Shoes"), Utf8("Music"), Utf8("Men")])]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
